      "## Review and next action\n\nName the owner who will read the result and set a review date. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix.\n\nChoose one action: fix the source, simplify the field, change the queue, or pause the work until the owner decides. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix.\n\nRepeat the protocol after the change and report what moved and what remains unknown. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix.\n\nName a backup owner for leave and time-zone gaps. Coverage should be written into the routine. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix.\n\nReview one approval matrix case end to end in the weekly meeting. Check the source, decision, destination record, and confirmation. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix.\n\nWhen evidence is unavailable, record that state instead of leaving a blank. Missing and confirmed negative are different. This applies to outsourceaccountspayable-measuring-backlog-age-in-approval-matrix."
